Num 20:1 , The children of Israel come to Zin, where Miriam dies;
Num 20:2 , They murmur for want of water;
Num 20:7 , Moses smiting the rock, brings forth water at Meribah;
Num 20:14 , Moses at Kadesh desires passage through Edom, which is denied him;
Num 20:22 , At mount Hor Aaron resigns his place to Eleazar, and dies.
